ocedure","printed_en_id":"en.0157.02","printed_fr_id":"fr.0148.03","see":[],"type":"sub"}],"groups":[{"meeting":14,"section":"14","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0330.03","meeting":14,"doc":"minutes","pdf":330,"printed":320,"texts":{"fr":"Lord Phillimore croit que Mr. Root a emprunté l'opinion qu'il a exprimée, à la pratique anglo-américaine des „demurrers”: l'une des parties accepte l'exposé des faits par l'autre partie, mais prétend que, en dépit de ces faits, l'argument de l'adversaire n'est pas justifié.","en":"Lord Phillimore thought that Mr. Root had borrowed the opinion he had formerly expressed from the \"demurrers\" of Anglo-American practice: one of the parties accepts the facts stated by the other party, but claims that, in spite of these facts, the opponent's argument is not justified.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0330.03","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.demurrers","weight":1.0,"end":120,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":2453,"start":74},{"concept":"c.demurrers","weight":1.0,"end":119,"label":"des „demurrers”","lang":"fr","start":105},{"concept":"c.demurrers","weight":0.6,"end":119,"label":"Demurrers","lang":"fr","start":110},{"concept":"c.demurrers","weight":0.6,"end":108,"label":"Demurrers","lang":"en","start":99}]}]},{"meeting":34,"section":"34","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0749.12","meeting":34,"doc":"annex","pdf":749,"printed":739,"texts":{"fr":"Une question délicate appelait l'attention du Comité. Il se peut que l'une des parties, dûment citée devant la Cour, refuse de comparaître; déniant compétence à la Cour, elle ne se présente que pour faire valoir cette exception, ou même ne se présente pas. Si la Cour estime que c'est un cas de sa…","en":"…If the Court considered that the case fell within its jurisdiction, it would continue to deal with it; but the defendant party, persisting in the attitude taken up, either would not appear, or if it had already appeared for the purpose of entering a demurrer against the Court's competence, would withdraw immediately afterwards; anyhow, in this or some other way, it would abstain from presenting its case. It may be asked if, under such circumstances, the demands of the plaintiff should not be accepted without calling for proofs. Some systems of national procedure adopt this principle, but it must not be forgotten that in the present case the …","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.demurrers","weight":1.0,"end":290,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":5906,"start":221}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":1},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":0},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"count":0},{"meeting":28,"count":0},{"meeting":29,"count":0},{"meeting":30,"count":0},{"meeting":31,"count":0},{"meeting":32,"count":0},{"meeting":33,"count":0},{"meeting":34,"count":1},{"meeting":35,"count":0}],"members":[{"id":"phillimore","name":"Lord Phillimore","count":1}],"passage_count":2,"sources":["Edition"],"includes_descendants":false}